{
  "manifest_version": 3,
  "name": "OA Corp：功能表隱藏按鈕",
  "version": "1.0",
  "description": "(corp-hide-menu-btn) 在 Corp 頁面注入浮動按鈕，可一鍵切換收合或展開左側導覽選單",
  "content_scripts": [
    {
      "matches": [
        "https://corp.orangeapple.co/*"
      ],
      "js": [
        "early-hide.js"
      ],
      "run_at": "document_start"
    },
    {
      "matches": [
        "https://corp.orangeapple.co/*"
      ],
      "js": [
        "content.js"
      ],
      "run_at": "document_idle"
    }
  ],
  "icons": {
    "16": "icon16.png",
    "48": "icon48.png",
    "128": "icon128.png"
  }
}